# Cargurus

> CarGurus is a trusted automotive marketplace that helps shoppers find great deals through data-driven listings, price analysis, expert reviews, and user insights.

## Tools & Data

> Tools and calculators that help shoppers estimate car values, compare vehicles, explore price trends, and research the market using objective, data-driven insights.

- [Car Valuation Tool](https://www.cargurus.com/research/car-valuation) Estimate the fair market value of any used car based on real-time listing data, mileage, condition, and local market trends. Useful for determining trade-in value, private sale pricing, and negotiation benchmarks.

- [Price Trends Tool](https://www.cargurus.com/research/price-trends) Analyze historical pricing trends for thousands of makes and models. This tool shows how used car prices are changing over time, helping shoppers understand seasonal patterns and whether it’s a good time to buy or sell.

- [Discover - AI Car Finder](https://www.cargurus.com/discover) Our industry-leading AI-powered vehicle discovery tool allows you to describe the car you need and get matched with recommended vehicles instantly.

- [Vehicle Comparison Tool](https://www.cargurus.com/research/compare) Compare cars side-by-side across key factors such as price, features, specifications, fuel economy, and ratings. Designed to help shoppers quickly evaluate the strengths and differences between multiple vehicles.

## SRP-pages

> Search Results Pages (SRPs) that surface vehicle listings and details for used car shoppers. In addition to all listings and filter options matching a particular search or vehicle type (ex: 2019 Honda Civics), each page provides unique data-backed generative shopping insights such as pricing trends, popular trims, feature highlights, user-review sentiment, model pros and cons, and local inventory patterns.

